# T4 · GAP-013 경로 자동완성 + CI-106 덤프 어휘(T-106 2/2 · 10-24): 우클릭 = 편집 시작 → 전체 선택 → "<root>/s" 입력 = 하위 폴더 sub 제안 →
# ↓ = 선택 0 → Esc = 팝업만 닫힘(편집 유지). 제안 항목은 잎 이름으로 덤프된다.
id: path-suggest
title: 경로 제안 팝업 덤프 · ↓ 선택 · Esc 닫기
tree: dir sub
tree: dir second
tree: file a.txt 3
settings: ui.lang=en
cmd: @ready:assert.panel:suggest closed
cmd: @ready:ui.rclick:@panel0.path
cmd: @ready:assert.panel:editing true
cmd: @ready:ui.key:ctrl+a
cmd: @ready:ui.type:<root>/s
cmd: @ready:panel.dump:<out>/open.txt
cmd: @ready:ui.press:down
cmd: @ready:panel.dump:<out>/down.txt
cmd: @ready:ui.press:escape
cmd: @ready:panel.dump:<out>/esc.txt
cmd: @ready:quit
check: open.txt: suggest open sel - items [second, sub]
check: down.txt: suggest open sel 0 items [second, sub]
check: esc.txt: editing true suggest closed
